WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.324 --> 00:00:04.806
Ellen's parents told her the news.

2
00:00:04.826 --> 00:00:08.288
A man—a brave hero—was willing to die for her.

3
00:00:36.844 --> 00:00:38.945
She jumped off her bed in joy.

4
00:00:38.965 --> 00:00:45.667
"Carry me to the lake!"

5
00:00:45.747 --> 00:00:48.387
Servants carried Ellen to the middle of the lake bed.

6
00:00:52.148 --> 00:00:54.709
A small boat was waiting there in the mud.

7
00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:58.490
It was filled with food and other supplies.

8
00:01:01.391 --> 00:01:03.012
The prince arrived, waving.

9
00:01:03.032 --> 00:01:04.152
"Here I am!"

10
00:01:09.232 --> 00:01:11.835
Still under the witch's spell, Ellen blinked.

11
00:01:11.855 --> 00:01:15.258
"I know him," she thought.

12
00:01:27.229 --> 00:01:28.951
The prince climbed into the hole.

13
00:01:31.473 --> 00:01:34.396
Water magically began flowing over the stone.

14
00:01:38.508 --> 00:01:40.028
"It's working," he thought.

15
00:01:40.048 --> 00:01:42.789
"The lake is filling up again."

16
00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:48.451
Ellen told the others to leave.

17
00:01:55.172 --> 00:01:57.453
She lay in the boat with her eyes shut.

18
00:02:01.374 --> 00:02:03.815
is very kind of you," she said.

19
00:02:03.835 --> 00:02:09.064
"You made me happy," the prince said.

20
00:02:09.084 --> 00:02:12.226
"We laughed all the time."

21
00:02:18.970 --> 00:02:22.512
Time went by, and waves began flowing over the stone.

22
00:02:26.494 --> 00:02:29.436
As the water rose, the boat began to float.

23
00:02:30.056 --> 00:02:31.317
The princess fell asleep.

24
00:02:31.337 --> 00:02:36.180
"Ellen!" The prince was hurt.

25
00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:39.222
"Your father promised that you would comfort me!"

26
00:02:40.743 --> 00:02:41.444
She yawned.

27
00:02:45.327 --> 00:02:46.508
too sleepy."

28
00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:49.231
The prince sighed.

29
00:02:51.593 --> 00:02:52.554
"Sleep then, darling.

30
00:02:53.154 --> 00:02:54.235
Don't worry about me."

31
00:02:54.255 --> 00:02:59.199
"You are very kind," she said.

32
00:02:59.219 --> 00:03:02.022
"Thank you.

33
00:03:02.322 --> 00:03:04.144
I think I will go back to sleep."

34
00:03:06.772 --> 00:03:08.614
"Can you give me some food first?"

35
00:03:09.134 --> 00:03:09.975
the prince asked.

36
00:03:13.538 --> 00:03:16.580
Reaching for the food, she looked at him for the first time.

37
00:03:23.286 --> 00:03:24.607
don't look very well."

38
00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:29.871
fine," he said.

39
00:03:29.891 --> 00:03:32.113
"I just need to eat."

40
00:03:34.215 --> 00:03:35.256
The princess fed him.

41
00:03:37.228 --> 00:03:40.710
Soon the sun went down, and the moon rose over the lake.

42
00:03:44.371 --> 00:03:47.332
By now waters were gushing around the prince's waist.

43
00:03:47.352 --> 00:03:53.075
"There's plenty of water now," Ellen said.

44
00:03:53.095 --> 00:03:55.776
"Let's go swimming!"

45
00:03:58.377 --> 00:03:59.557
The prince shook his head.

46
00:03:59.577 --> 00:04:03.679
"I'm afraid I've had my last swim," he said sadly.

47
00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:06.200
Ellen laughed.

48
00:04:14.284 --> 00:04:14.484
"Silly me.

49
00:04:14.504 --> 00:04:14.804
I forgot!"

50
00:04:14.824 --> 00:04:16.625
The water kept rising, reaching his neck.

51
00:04:17.965 --> 00:04:18.925
The prince felt weak.

52
00:04:19.826 --> 00:04:21.566
He knew the end was near.

53
00:04:21.586 --> 00:04:24.847
"Will you kiss me, princess?"

54
00:04:25.207 --> 00:04:25.727
he asked.

55
00:04:25.747 --> 00:04:29.308
"Then I can die happy."

56
00:04:29.568 --> 00:04:31.969
"Of course."

57
00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:37.711
As she leaned forward, the princess stared at the man's face.

58
00:04:40.071 --> 00:04:41.572
And finally it struck her.

59
00:04:49.069 --> 00:04:50.155
This was her prince.

60
00:04:50.738 --> 00:04:51.804
And he was dying!
